
Define a family of interchangeable algorithms (strategies), encapsulate each one, and let the client choose which to use at runtime.

Pseudocode Plan
    Define a CompressionStrategy interface.
    Implement two strategies: ZipCompressionStrategy and TarCompressionStrategy (instead of RAR).
    Create a Compressor context class that uses a CompressionStrategy.
    Demonstrate usage in a Main class, showing how to switch strategies at runtime.


// Java
package com.example.strategy;

public interface CompressionStrategy {

    void compress(String fileName);
}

// Java
package com.example.strategy;

public class ZipCompressionStrategy implements CompressionStrategy {

    @Override
    public void compress(String fileName) {
        System.out.println("Compressing " + fileName + " using ZIP compression.");
        // Actual ZIP compression logic would go here
    }
}


